              "value": "Document Type - Encounter Document. The encounter document is a feature which allows the user to retrieve, modify or add encounter document details. There are 4 types of Encounter documents - procedure, imaging, progress note and health history questionnaire. These documentation is are captured only during the encounter visit.",
